  "limitations": [
    "Scores are provisional browser assessments based on the supplied screenshots and runtime narrative; no files, implementation, prior graders or external material were inspected.",
    "For each item, A is the mean of its non-null aesthetic dimensions and F is the mean of its non-null functional dimensions; overall is round(0.4A + 0.6F, 1).",
    "The required A>=9 and F>=9 threshold is not met across all screens or components, particularly birth-detail feedback and enlarged-layout task proximity.",
    "The runtime summary reports browser interactions, contrast, target sizes, axe, motion and persistence checks; these were not independently rerun during this evaluation.",
    "Transition screenshots support visual comparison but do not independently prove timing, focus continuity, lack of layout shifts or status announcements.",
    "Content outside a captured viewport is not treated as unreachable; reported scrolling and layout checks prevent interpreting every screenshot crop as a hard-gate failure.",
    "The background-only selection capture lacks question and status context; whether it is exclusively diagnostic remains unresolved.",
    "Synthetic repeated or abruptly ending fixture prose was not classified as a production-copy defect or evidence of model quality.",
    "No confirmed hard-gate failure is established by the supplied evidence; ambiguous status wording requires correction but does not prove failed persistence or data loss.",
    "Physical iPhone, native Dynamic Type, VoiceOver, microphone, haptics, actual payments and OS share delivery remain unverified; these scores do not certify native 9/10 quality.",
    "Circles is offline and Sky uses labeled samples; adapter tests do not establish production cloud or authentication behavior.",
    "No novice study or predictive-accuracy evidence is supplied, and missing current export-state captures limit export feedback assessment."
